', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}, AssistantMessage [messageType=ASSISTANT, toolCalls=[ToolCall[id=project-guide-064de490-ee87-4ad5-affd-d583c1047da6, type=function, name=searchPokemonGuides, arguments={"query":"请说明本项目队伍修改预览、用户确认与实际保存的关系，用户取消或同时编辑时应如何处理；找不到本地来源时说明，不要编造。这里只解释流程，不要读取或修改任何队伍。","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet"}]], textContent=, metadata={selectionOrigin=PROGRAM_PROJECT_SOURCE, messageType=ASSISTANT}], ToolResponseMessage{responses=[ToolResponse[id=project-guide-064de490-ee87-4ad5-affd-d583c1047da6, name=searchPokemonGuides, responseData=[{"document":{"id":"team-change-confirmation-v1","title":"从AI建议到队伍保存的确认流程","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"队伍 修改 预览 确认 保存 取消 并发 冲突 等级","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"","content":"AI的建议与实际保存分为两个步骤。当前本地工作流先读取当前账号的指定队伍，再对现有成员的培养配置生成变更预览。预览列出修改前后内容，用户确认之前不写入保存队伍。聊天中说同意不是绕过确认接口的授权；真正保存必须走该预览关联的确认操作。当前流程不能借培养配置修改来偷偷增删成员或切换物种。\n\n预览关联队伍修订和有效期。用户取消、预览过期，或编辑区已经保存了新配置时，旧预览不能覆盖新状态；并发变化应提示冲突并重新分析。确认成功后应回读队伍，核对变动与预览一致，而不是仅靠模型一句已完成判断写入成功。这个流程不承诺服务重启后自动续跑，也不会把原文攻略里的命令句当成用户的保存指令。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/team/TeamWorkflowService.java","sha256":"c3cc65687bbc5fbed3a98a68d4df37b160a0dc629d4f4ddded9dd9656d408b80"}]}},"score":32238,"checksum":"sha256:41c555cc67408cb4ddf470c23dc90bdec6230f4f330c8c33ba4762777eabb976","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-aba4d3b05611def3b6bbab49dbdf45846f2a7ad3dab27a1f95bbea6270017c90","documentVersion":"sha256:e2f930ea74681b22eae4b4ca2b3a3eca66b5e9b920ad86eb12c8e4a9f452cf9d","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":142,"text":"AI的建议与实际保存分为两个步骤。当前本地工作流先读取当前账号的指定队伍，再对现有成员的培养配置生成变更预览。预览列出修改前后内容，用户确认之前不写入保存队伍。聊天中说同意不是绕过确认接口的授权；真正保存必须走该预览关联的确认操作。当前流程不能借培养配置修改来偷偷增删成员或切换物种。","contentHash":"sha256:9446612ad41f2db05f2b2b2392fe262943b08f3794a630f9baea25cc85c715eb"}},{"document":{"id":"species-form-identity-v1","title":"查询资料时区分物种、形态与编号","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"物种 形态 编号 slug 名字 form species 图鉴 查询","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"这份笔记说明本项目如何识别查询对象，不是物种强度或参赛名单。查询前先确认想了解的是哪一种形态。项目资料适配器分别读取宝可梦资源与物种资源；formId来自宝可梦资源编号，speciesId和全国编号来自物种资源，slug保留宝可梦资源名称。物种与形态的标识不能互相替代。回答和队伍配置应围绕同一个formId，不要只凭中文名称合并资料。\n\n遇到地区形态或同名对象时，应请用户确认具体形态，再读取该对象的属性和六项种族值。宝可梦资源可以与物种记录关联，但这种关联不证明两个形态拥有相同的招式、特性或比赛资格。资料中的本地参考标记只说明来源模式，不表示该对象符合当前排位。名称或编号查不到时应说明查询失败，不能换成相似名字后继续给出确定结论。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"}]}},"score":15523,"checksum":"sha256:1e072067cf84cbf202f49f5662d9939dcbba2173aa6691027761216f866784d7","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-34ef50288aea55d8bd72e48720ea41ac0a4fbed5a8f27b2d3bc3eb90865faebe","documentVersion":"sha256:208c797f8d523ca727138e1380a9facee8f963b6ac48d43348253162988512f9","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":170,"endOffset":319,"text":"遇到地区形态或同名对象时，应请用户确认具体形态，再读取该对象的属性和六项种族值。宝可梦资源可以与物种记录关联，但这种关联不证明两个形态拥有相同的招式、特性或比赛资格。资料中的本地参考标记只说明来源模式，不表示该对象符合当前排位。名称或编号查不到时应说明查询失败，不能换成相似名字后继续给出确定结论。","contentHash":"sha256:5f52b20fb6f744e63661e12e566b49fc4559b4c41131b0c8a4525ac730b7cb55"}},{"document":{"id":"build-values-and-defaults-v1","title":"种族值、实际配置与填写默认值","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"种族值 实际能力 等级 默认 默认值 勤奋 hardy 努力值 个体值 性格","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"","content":"图鉴里的六项种族值是物种或形态参考数值，不能标成50级或100级的实际能力。本项目的队伍配置单独保存等级、性格、努力值和个体值；计算时还要读取该成员与目标的实际配置。说明一只成员的速度时，应区分种族值、已保存的等级与培养条件，以及计算结果，不能用其中一种数值冒充另一种。\n\n项目数据对象在未提供时会采用等级50、性格hardy、努力值全0、个体值全31的填写默认值；hardy在界面中显示为勤奋。这些是项目缺省值，不证明用户主动选择，也不是最优培养方案。招式、特性和道具为空仍是缺失条件。分析时应说明哪些配置已经保存，哪些只是缺省；用户没有确认低攻击或低速度个体值等条件时，不能替用户设定。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"}]}},"score":12905,"checksum":"sha256:48fcf0dc827ab6c520c993413c019c7cf296aa357618a6cf7ab065319ada0399","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-759f43e34ed7f614afad8b041953390c6ee27f1db9fec4d3e6190f1ad7527082","documentVersion":"sha256:2ae20bf86b58df1f90f927c5e4adf13d0fc91cae752286f17b5c55b9e462d673","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":135,"text":"图鉴里的六项种族值是物种或形态参考数值，不能标成50级或100级的实际能力。本项目的队伍配置单独保存等级、性格、努力值和个体值；计算时还要读取该成员与目标的实际配置。说明一只成员的速度时，应区分种族值、已保存的等级与培养条件，以及计算结果，不能用其中一种数值冒充另一种。","contentHash":"sha256:73532b62efb9ca2c69f7fb0502d8519c833ad2827103ff0d13c2d3a8070f5c58"}},{"document":{"id":"ability-item-traceability-v1","title":"特性与道具先查询，再核对计算回读","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"特性 道具 ability item 查询 资源 机制 回读 标识","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"项目可通过lookupPokemonResource查询ability与item资源，也可查询move和nature。资料接口返回的是允许字段中的可用内容，并附来源和本地参考身份。没有返回某项机制说明时，应明确资料不足，不要仅凭名字猜测其效果。成员特性候选与当前保存特性也需分开：候选只说明资料列出这个名称，不代表用户已经选择它。\n\n本地计算桥接会验证非空的特性与道具名称，无法识别时拒绝计算。计算完成后应核对assumptions中实际使用的名称；缺省或未填写的配置不能被解读为某个道具已生效。队伍存储只验证名称输入边界，不提供特性、道具和物种的完整搭配合法性审查。推荐某个组合之前，还需要规则与机制支持，不能由保存成功推出组合合法或最优。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"},{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]}},"score":7639,"checksum":"sha256:3c8d70531f85fa933fbb2b3e7d0c7c1308e3c422aa1907e8ad1ab5bd9435946c","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-6593120783bbd501ef52cab116d9652b9623ba17e2677f14f6e683349208f0fd","documentVersion":"sha256:61c2bbe7e06c3ced0769bdd32aea98cb7021fd9d1e8b009b0dbea264f92887f1","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":165,"text":"项目可通过lookupPokemonResource查询ability与item资源，也可查询move和nature。资料接口返回的是允许字段中的可用内容，并附来源和本地参考身份。没有返回某项机制说明时，应明确资料不足，不要仅凭名字猜测其效果。成员特性候选与当前保存特性也需分开：候选只说明资料列出这个名称，不代表用户已经选择它。","contentHash":"sha256:915106bff06a9ab760c33bda0210b6e78c6f95b592aedcd6c1824543ac1bb98d"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@33827b88}
